# Paths Semgrep skips when scanning this repo.
#
# A custom .semgrepignore replaces Semgrep's built-in default ignores, so the
# defaults are repeated here. Only add generated files. Hand-written code,
# docs and build files stay in the scan. Changes to this file get a
# sensitive-file notice on the PR.

# Semgrep defaults
node_modules/
build/
dist/
vendor/
.env/
.venv/
.tox/
*.min.js
.npm/
.yarn/
test/
tests/
*_test.go
.semgrep
.semgrep_logs/

# Generated: compiler golden outputs (rewritten by tools/ci/compiler_goldens)
tools/ci/compiler_goldens/
compiler/companion/golden_corpus/expected/
*.golden

# Generated: rules_jvm_external Maven lock files
maven_install.json
*_install.json
